    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/seoul-crown-88-guest-house/hotel/seoul-kr.html",
    "name": "Seoul Crown 88 Guest House - Foreigners only",
    "detail": "First, I booked for 3 days 2 nights when I arrived Seoul. But after I stayed here, I felt like home, then I changed my plan to come back and stay here again for the last 4 days 3 nights of my trip. The location was great as there are many restaurants around, also minimart and pharmacy. However, it might be inconvenience for those who carry many huge luggages as it requires 7-10 mins walk from Hongik Subway station. But if you don't mind (because it's going to be only when you check-in and check-out), there are elevators and escalators at the station to exit no.3, so it's not that hard anyway. The room is nice and clean. Shower room is inside the room which sharing with only 4 people maximum who staying. The lounge is well decorated with a big TV, comfy sofa and the kitchen bar in the back that you can hang around in the morning or at night. Internet is good. The lady is super nice, speak well in English, Chinese, and Korean. She gave a good help in both staying wise and travel wise. Overall, I would recommend this place to all travellers.",
